# eezycycle-landing Conventions

Apply whenever creating or editing files under `eezycycle-landing/`.

## Colors (mandatory)

Use **only** tokens from `eezycycle-landing/src/app/globals.css`. Do not invent hex/rgb/hsl in components, Tailwind arbitrary values, or inline styles.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
className="bg-[#E85078] text-[#1E1719]"
style={{ color: '#E85078' }}

// ✅ GOOD — Tailwind theme tokens
className="bg-primary text-text-primary border-border"

// ✅ GOOD — CSS variables when needed
style={{ background: 'var(--gradient-app)' }}
```

| Need | Token |
|------|--------|
| Brand | `primary`, `primary-light`, `secondary`, `accent` |
| Surfaces | `background`, `surface`, `border` |
| Text | `text-primary`, `text-secondary`, `foreground` |
| Cycle | `period`, `ovulation`, `fertility`, `pregnancy`, `perimenopause` |
| Feedback | `success`, `warning`, `error`, `info` |
| Gradients | `var(--gradient-app)`, `var(--gradient-soft)`, … |

New brand colors → add to `:root` + `@theme inline` in `globals.css` first, then use them.

## Folder structure

```
eezycycle-landing/src/
├── app/                 # routes only (page, layout, loading, metadata)
│   ├── globals.css      # single source of color tokens
│   ├── layout.tsx
│   └── page.tsx
├── components/          # UI pieces
│   ├── ui/              # reusable primitives (Button, Section, …)
│   └── sections/        # page sections (Hero, Features, …)
├── lib/                 # shared helpers, constants (non-UI)
└── hooks/               # shared React hooks
```

- Keep `app/` thin: compose sections, no duplicated markup across pages
- Shared UI → `components/ui/`; one-off page blocks → `components/sections/`
- No parallel roots (`helpers/`, `common/`, `shared/` beside the above)

## DRY

1. Same markup/styles twice → extract a component under `components/`
2. Same logic twice → extract to `lib/` or `hooks/`
3. Do not copy color/spacing “one-offs”; extend tokens or shared components
4. Prefer composition over large monolithic `page.tsx` files
